{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてすみません"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでると元気が湧いてきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして勉強にもなります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発表があってから、\nなんて伝えたらいいのかな......\n考えましたが..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあや族さん達には\nまあやらしく正直に伝えようと決めました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『乃木どこ』\n見てくださった方はわかると思います......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今の気持ちをblogに書きたいと思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はこの前の選抜発表で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何で？\nってアンダーの皆は頑張ってたよ!!\nって.........。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族と離れて１人で東京に来て、\n大好きな友達とも離れて、\nせめて地元の中学を卒業したかった...\n修学旅行だって、\n大好きな友達と行きたかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せめて一段落してから東京に来たかった......\nもっともっと皆と思い出作りたかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっともっと皆といたかった......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って、思いました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそうはいかない..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は１人で東京に来た"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来たからには頑張った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始めてのことだらけで、\n何もかもがわからないことばかりで........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、考えれば、地元の友達と修学旅行行きたかったとしても、卒業したかったとしても、プラスに考えれば、東京で凄く成長した"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、私がまだ地元にいたとしたら、ここまで成長してないと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"甘ったれてて成長してないと思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"修学旅行だの成長だの関係ない！\nって思う人もいるかもしれない！\nでも私はそう考えます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京の学校だって皆となじむのは難しかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この新しい学校には地元の友達もいない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆知らない人、\n最初は友達なんてつくらなくてもいいや！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人でいいや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ってた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校行くのは辛かった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"学校に行くのも途中までいって帰ったり、自然と涙があふれてきて\n行きたくない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って最初はずっとそんな日々が続いた......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までとは環境が全く違って...\nきっと精神的にもついていけてなかったんだと思う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもそんなとき、家族や、かずみん(高山和実)やロッティーちゃん達、メンバーが\nずっと相談にのってくれてたんだ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それがあって凄く支えられた\n前向きに！\nポジティブに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"考えらるようになったの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから今はこの学校にきてよかった！\nって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"友達もできてよかった！\nって......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は学校に行くのが凄く楽しいの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私がブログ更新遅れると心配してくれたり、笑わせてくれたりしてくれるまあや族さん達、\n家族、マネージャーさん、私を構ってくれるメンバー...ほんとーにありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クラスの友達...\n仲良くしてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして先生！\nこれからもよろしくお願いします"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーからの選抜入りした\nアミアミもあしゅりんも凄く頑張ってたし凄く嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、新たな新メンバー\nの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"秋元真夏ちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初だから、馴染めなかったり、不安もあると思うけど、\n皆いい人だからぁー！笑笑笑えへへー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバー恥ずかしがりやさん多いけど、話したらめんどくさいほど\n話してくるよー！笑笑笑"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、新しいお姉ちゃんが出来てうれしーです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初は正直いうと、私、器が小さいから、心が広くないから......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『なんで？』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って思ったよ.........ごめん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも今は違う"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"家族みたいな仲間でありライバルでもある......\n特別な存在だよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏ちゃんは真夏ちゃんで頑張ってる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだダンスのフリとかわかんないかなぁって思って、偉そうかなって思ったんたけど、\nまあやが踊ったのを、\n真夏ちゃんが動画を撮ったりして、一生懸命フリとか覚えてるよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてね、\n真夏ちゃんはね、オシャレさんだから今度一緒にお買い物つれてってもらいたいのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うへへへ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また今度レッスン前に一緒にアイス買いに行こうね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これから、乃木坂46\n34人、今までどうり一致団結して、仲良く頑張って、\nまた、坂道のぼっていきます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2012/10/08/%E3%81%BE%E3%81%82%E3%82%84%EF%BC%93.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/10/08/6456194/0002.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}